  "slug": "hummus-without-a-food-processor",
  "name": "Hummus Without a Food Processor",
  "recipe_type": "appetizer",
  "brief_description": "Creamy hummus is still possible to make without a food processor when you have a potato masher, tahini, and chickpeas on hand.",
  "cuisine": "Middle Eastern",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Mash chickpeas, 2 tablespoons reserved chickpea liquid, tahini, sesame oil, red pepper flakes, and garlic powder together in a bowl using a potato masher, adding more reserved liquid if desired, until hummus is desired consistency, 50 to 100 strokes."
    }
  ],
